{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME WHAT YOU HAVE IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rock Simulator 2, you\u2019re more than just a collector. You\u2019re an observer of time and nature. Unlock over 100 different rocks, each representing a piece of the world around us. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth is not a race. Unlock and upgrade your rocks, and with each step forward, learn to appreciate the slow and methodical pace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience peaceful environments with friends. There\u2019s no pressure here. Sit together in silence or chat while watching the sun dip below the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends in serene environments, watching the sun sink below the horizon. No need for words. A quiet acknowledgment of existence and connection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AMBIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the soundscapes guide you. Listen to rain, wind, or gentle music as you immerse yourself in the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is not only measured by speed but by endurance. How long can you simply <i>be</i>? The leaderboard honors those who understand that existing fully in each moment is an achievement of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something hidden in the rocks.  Be curious. Pay attention. The answers reveal themselves to those who truly look.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Timeless Object","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/2d15daa87878c0d3a6a89e75ca56623ae4b24a39.jpg"},{"name":"A Witness of Creation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/f7319b3a31c8d834384bb282508e0a83c5dd4109.jpg"},{"name":"The Journey of Patience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/1e125b858e3b774de39b59c8aaa947f341b0b41c.jpg"},{"name":"Limitless, Unbound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/232efff1cd4281362b682b3065bf0383c941b859.jpg"},{"name":"10%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/272b02e02a4ee2c50b7d1e69298d372511f43582.jpg"},{"name":"The Rock Brought You Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/0a10d144d480174fdd1292bf29ab715928407731.jpg"},{"name":"No Judgement, No Fear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/a075d682569c3caa0daf124e8a6c6276fa20b2a5.jpg"},{"name":"A Mindful Task","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/847594bd00aefa3cb9158973aabf43489dd07429.jpg"},{"name":"Become.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/f88cc88c106593f21c8195ea89130a0f721dd3b5.jpg"},{"name":"LUMEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1949770/b00ad120ddb3c3867411ea54d7383bfe88d5b171.jpg"}],"total":151},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1949770?t=1767753642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1949770?t=1767753642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/7ac33d225768c1488fe8d4195a92cc12b4f6d12b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767753642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/7ac33d225768c1488fe8d4195a92cc12b4f6d12b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767753642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME WHAT YOU HAVE IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rock Simulator 2, you\u2019re more than just a collector. You\u2019re an observer of time and nature. Unlock over 100 different rocks, each representing a piece of the world around us. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5588c836530788fb40597524ce619932.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth is not a race. Unlock and upgrade your rocks, and with each step forward, learn to appreciate the slow and methodical pace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience peaceful environments with friends. There\u2019s no pressure here. Sit together in silence or chat while watching the sun dip below the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.poster.avif?t=1767753642\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.webm?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.mp4?t=1767753642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends in serene environments, watching the sun sink below the horizon. No need for words. A quiet acknowledgment of existence and connection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AMBIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the soundscapes guide you. Listen to rain, wind, or gentle music as you immerse yourself in the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is not only measured by speed but by endurance. How long can you simply <i>be</i>? The leaderboard honors those who understand that existing fully in each moment is an achievement of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something hidden in the rocks.  Be curious. Pay attention. The answers reveal themselves to those who truly look.</p>","developers":["vinoo"],"dlc":[4212010,4212000],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/header.jpg?t=1767753642","is_free":false,"linux_requirement